              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.26.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 26:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omu biro ebyo aba Ziifu bainamuka owa Saulo Gibea, baagira bati: Ebyo noomanya ku Daudi ayesherekire omuriitwe omu kibira ky'omu kibungo kya Hakila, ekiri aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo bw'eihamba? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu Nyakusinga, shuuma, oyemare ekikuri aha mutima; ekyaitu n'okumuhayo omu mikono y'omugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo yaagira ati: MUKAMA abahe omugisha; ahakuba mwangirira esaasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwirooko, mwongyere kuhamya, mwetegyereze mureebe omwanya ogu ayesherekiremu, kandi mumanye n'omureebire; ahakuba nibangambira omushaija ogwo ku aba omunyabwengye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo mureebe, mwetegyereze obweshereko bwe bwona, ahu ayesherekire, haza mugarukye mundeetere enkuru ehamire, naanye niinyija kugyenda naimwe; ku araabe ari omuri egyo nsi, niinyija kumusherura omu nkumi zoona ez'Abayuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batyo baimuka, baaza Ziifu, baatangayo Saulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu bunaku obwo Daudi n'abashaija be bakaba bari omu ihamba rya Maoni omuri Araba, aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo bwa Yeshimooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo n'abantu be baaza kumusherura; haabaho abaagambira Daudi; n'ahabw'ekyo yaaza aha ibaare rihango ery'omu ihamba rya Maoni, yaagumayo. Saulo ku yaakihuriire, yaamukurata omuri eryo ihamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo yaareetwa aha rubaju rumwe rw'ekibungo, na Daudi n'abantu be aha rundi; obwo Daudi akaba nairuka naahunga Saulo, ahakuba Saulo n'engabo ze bakaba nibenda kubakubira ahagati kubakwata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.22.1+2SA.22.2+2SA.22.3+2SA.22.4+2SA.22.5+2SA.22.6+2SA.22.7+2SA.22.8+2SA.22.9+2SA.22.10+2SA.22.11+2SA.22.12+2SA.22.13+2SA.22.14+2SA.22.15+2SA.22.16+2SA.22.17+2SA.22.18+2SA.22.19+2SA.22.20+2SA.22.21+2SA.22.22+2SA.22.23+2SA.22.24+2SA.22.25+2SA.22.26+2SA.22.27+2SA.22.28+2SA.22.29+2SA.22.30+2SA.22.31+2SA.22.32+2SA.22.33+2SA.22.34+2SA.22.35+2SA.22.36+2SA.22.37+2SA.22.38+2SA.22.39+2SA.22.40+2SA.22.41+2SA.22.42+2SA.22.43+2SA.22.44+2SA.22.45+2SA.22.46+2SA.22.47+2SA.22.48+2SA.22.49+2SA.22.50+2SA.22.51"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 22:1-51",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.37.6+ISA.37.7+ISA.37.8+ISA.37.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 37:6-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka haija entumwa ahari Saulo, yaamugira eti: Rahuka ogarukye; ahakuba Abafilistia baahurura kuteera ensi yaitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo Saulo yaagarukayo, yaarereera kukurata Daudi, yaaza kurwanisa Abafilistia. Nikyo baayeteire ogwo mwanya Sela-hama-lekoosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Daudi yaarugayo, yainamuka, yaaguma omu bigo bya Enigeedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
